          "text": "**Evaluating JSON processing**\n\nI’m looking at a JSON array of objects and recalling a past error regarding indexing with \"html_url,\" which may have arisen from some entries being strings. The top-level file might have trailing or broken lines, specifically at line 57573. A safer method might be to use `try` with jq, but I could also stream the parsed JSON with `jq -c '.[] | {fields}'` and collect it into an array. I’ll make sure to use `map(select(type==\"object\") | { ... })` to only process objects. That should help avoid the error.",
