          "text": "**Comparing and Committing Changes**\n\nI must compare the existing file in Python. If the file hasn’t changed, I'll call a no-operation (noop) and exit with a message indicating no change. If there are changes, I need to create a new branch, commit those changes, and call the `create_pull_request` tool. The instructions state that I must create a local branch that matches the current git branch and handle everything locally before the safe-output manages the push. My script should generate the HTML string first, read the existing file content, and implement these guidelines carefully.",
