        {
          "text": "**Extracting Sections with Regex**\n\nI'm planning to use regex to find sections for highlights and fixes in the release notes. For highlights, I'll search for headers that match certain patterns and capture the following lines until the next blank line or header. If nothing’s found, I can take the first paragraph limited to around 300 characters. For the fixes summary, I’ll look for headings with \"fix,\" gathering bullets beneath them. If none are found, I’ll return \"None listed.\" Additionally, I must ensure to escape values and safely serialize the release data. I'll implement styles and provide controls for filtering results while sorting the releases.",
